      <title>荣耀WIN首代手机取消风扇区导热凝胶 官方解释散热调控逻辑</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260901/%E8%8D%A3%E8%80%80WIN%E9%A6%96%E4%BB%A3%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E5%8F%96%E6%B6%88%E9%A3%8E%E6%89%87%E5%8C%BA%E5%AF%BC%E7%83%AD%E5%87%9D%E8%83%B6-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%E6%95%A3%E7%83%AD%E8%B0%83%E6%8E%A7%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91/</link>
